      "program_name": "Inclusionary Housing Ordinance and housing impact fee (repealed June 7, 2022)",
      "administering_agency": "San Luis Obispo County Department of Planning and Building",
      "funding_type": "regulatory requirement",
      "typical_award_size": "Ordinances 3471 (Title 22 Section 22.12.040), 3472 (Title 23 Section 23.04.096) and 3473 (Title 29) repealed the inclusionary requirement and discontinued collection of in-lieu and housing impact fees effective June 7, 2022. Title 29 remains only to spend pre-repeal balances.",
